  3. PRODUCT IDENTITY F_n * L_n = F_{2n}
========================================================================

Extended doubling chain from F_8 = 21:
  F_4 = 3, L_4 = 7, F_8 = 21 = 21
  F_8 = 21, L_8 = 47, F_16 = 987 = 987
  F_16 = 987, L_16 = 2207, F_32 = 2178309
  F_32 = 2178309 = 3 * 7 * 47 * 2207

